    ["0:\"自身Root位置\",1:\"默认目标Root位置\",2:\"位置 黑板值里的已有位置\",3:\"右摇杆拖拽传入位置\""] = "0: \"Own Root position\", 1: \"Default target Root position\", 2: \"Position already in Blackboard value\", 3: \"Position passed in by right stick drag\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>至尊甲胄\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Supreme Armor\nWhen the King arrives, an era is paved for him; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<Italic>——有什么东西在你的皮肤下燃烧，把你从内到外染成猩红的月色。 你的力量远超常人，那些想要束缚你的枷锁，在你眼中不过是笑话。 可你的人性也在逐渐流失，你的认知开始错乱，无法感知到敌友的区别。 你的非凡之力在涌动，却不听你的命令。 你的躯体在发出暗红的光，就像一根即将烧断的引线。你已在危险的边缘，下一步，就是深渊。</>"] = "<Italic>—Something is burning beneath your skin, dyeing you from the inside out in the color of a scarlet moon. Your strength far exceeds that of an ordinary person; those shackles that sought to bind you are nothing but a joke in your eyes. Yet, your humanity is also gradually slipping away; your perception is becoming distorted, and you cannot distinguish between friend and foe. Your Beyonder powers are surging, but they no longer obey your commands. Your body is emitting a dark red light, like a fuse about to burn out. You are on the edge of danger; the next step is the abyss.</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：我们永远在刀尖上跳舞，却没发现脚下的幸运早就飘走啦。"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: We are always dancing on the edge of a blade, never noticing that the luck beneath our feet has long since drifted away.",
    ["Mesh-瓜摊"] = "Mesh - Melon Stall",
    ["{{先生|小姐}}！蒙特利大师的《伯爵归来》正在金梧桐剧场热映！"] = "{{Mr.|Ms.}}! Master Monterey's \"The Count's Return\" is now showing at the Golden Phoenix Theater!",
    ["——在那个世界里，梅高欧丝一战无人牺牲。圣堂随后给予守护了全廷根的值夜者小队任职贝克兰德的机会，但邓恩和弗莱都拒绝了。\n\n      戴莉从贝克兰德赶回来时已是深夜，她照例拎了一瓶邓恩和弗莱都爱喝的酒。\n      “所以，你真拒绝了圣堂的邀请？”她靠在桌边，目光落在邓恩脸上。\n      邓恩抬起头，看向她。火光在他灰色的眼睛里轻轻晃了晃。\n      “你比我更适合那里。”他说，声音平静而厚重，“在廷根，这里的人认得我，我也认得每一条街、每一扇窗。我想留在这里，继续守护着它。”\n      弗莱默默给自己倒了一杯，举起来：“我也是。”\n      戴莉沉默片刻，轻声笑了一下：“就知道你会这么说。”\n      她拎过酒瓶也满上。三只杯子在壁炉前碰到一起，清脆的一声响。\n      窗外的廷根，在不眠的守护者注视中，安安静静地睡着。"] = "—In that world, no one sacrificed their life in the battle against Megose. The Cathedral subsequently gave the Nighthawks squad that guarded all of Tingen the opportunity to take up posts in Backlund, but Dunn and Frye both refused. \n\n      Daly returned from Backlund late at night; she brought a bottle of the wine that both Dunn and Frye loved, as was her custom. \n      \"So, you really refused the Cathedral's invitation?\" She leaned against the table, her gaze resting on Dunn's face. \n      Dunn looked up at her. The firelight flickered gently in his gray eyes. \n      \"You are more suited for that place than I am,\" he said, his voice calm and heavy. \"In Tingen, the people here know me, and I know every street, every window. I want to stay here and continue guarding it.\" \n      Frye silently poured himself a glass and raised it: \"Me too.\" \n      Daly was silent for a moment, then laughed softly: \"I knew you would say that.\" \n      She grabbed the bottle and filled her own glass. Three glasses clinked together in front of the fireplace with a crisp sound. \n      Outside the window, Tingen slept quietly under the watchful eyes of the sleepless Guardians.",
